# Compiled audio daemon. Built locally with ./lib/build.sh, which ad-hoc signs it
# with a stable identifier so the microphone grant survives across runs. Deliberately
# not shipped: a downloaded binary arrives quarantined and carries someone else's
# signature, so it would fail its TCC grant rather than just work.
visualizer.widget/lib/visualizerd
